    "files": [
      {
        "description": "This file contains eight tables: - Tables S1 and S2 contain water properties (T, pH, EC, δ2H, δ18O, d) for Kolyma and Y3, respectively.\r\n- Tables S3 and S4 list DOC, total dissolved nitrogen (TDN), POC and TPN for Kolyma and Y3 water samples, respectively. \r\n- Tables S5 and S6 provide stable and radiocarbon isotopic data for POC of Kolyma and Y3 water samples, respectively. \r\n- Tables S7 and S8 summarize POC lipid biomarker results for Kolyma and Y3 water samples, respectively.\r\n",
